[0.001, "o", "  {\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"UserPromptSubmit\",\"additionalContext\":\"[PORT DADDY — SITREP enforce]\\nEnd EVERY turn with a SITREP markdown table (scaffold: pd sitrep --template):\\n| Idea / Suggestion / Remediation | Source (Agent/Operator) | Status | Related PR/Issue | Docs / Roadmap Link |\\nTrack every idea raised this session, every roadmap claim, and work assigned by other agents; update Status with the turn's progress and carry unresolved rows forward.\\nA row you are writing code for MUST carry a roadmap link from the moment it is created — mint one first: pd roadmap upsert <slug> --summary \\\"...\\\" --estimate <units>.\\nenforce: a turn that ends without the table is an incomplete turn — emit it before yielding.\"}}\r\n\r\n"]
